<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.75/1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.75/1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were unevenly $0.75 to $1.50 higher. Trading fairly active. Top $61.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   60.50-61.50,</p>
<p>	    opened mostly 61.00-61.50</p>
<p>	    later mostly  60.50-61.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   60.00-61.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   59.00-60.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs   58.00-59.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs   57.00-58.50</p>
<p>Sows 1.00 to 1.50 higher. Top 56.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    54.00-56.00</p>
</text>
